uild_callargs: the call's arguments from the paramflags, the masks of the out and inout"] [346 1 "// parameters, the count of the values returned."] [438 1 "// buildResult is _build_result: the out parameters' values (by __ctypes_from_outparam__) and the inout ones."] [476 1 "// resultType is the ffi type of a restype (None: void; nil: int; a callable that is no ctypes type: int)."] [497 1 "// aggElems: a struct's elements for ci's call, bytes of its size (ci copies the aggregate's bytes: only the size and"] [498 1 "// the alignment matter)."] [520 1 "// getResult is GetResult: the result's bytes as restype wants them."] [540 3 "// a py_object result is the reference the function returned, now Python's (GetResult's Py_XDECREF after O_get)"] [556 1 "// ---- callbacks (callbacks.c) ----"] [558 1 "// newCallback is _ctypes_alloc_callback: a closure of the type's interface calling callable."] [598 1 "// callPythonObject is _CallPythonObject: the C arguments made Python objects, the callable called, its result"] [599 1 "// written as restype; an exception is reported as unraisable and the result left zero."] [633 3 "// a result whose memory needs an object kept alive (a char *'s bytes) leaks past the callback (callbacks.c)"] [644 3 "// widened as ffi_arg, by its signedness"] [676 1 "// ---- PyCFuncPtr_new ----"] [705 3 "// (name_or_ordinal, dll)"] [723 76 "// PyCFuncPtr_FromDll's audit (queue 598)"] [761 1 "// dllHandle is the dll object's _handle (an int)."] [778 1 "// ---- dlopen ----"] [780 1 "// The world's names: the libraries a ctypes program may load (244-2 (a))."] [784 1 "// loadedLibs are the names dlopen opened, in order (py-accel: _ctypes.dllist's answer after the program and the world's libc)."] [790 1 "// dllist is callproc.c's dllist over dl_iterate_phdr: the loaded objects' names, the program first (named \"\", as"] [791 1 "// dl_iterate_phdr names it), then the world's musl as \"libc.so\", then each library a dlopen named (the world answers"] [792 1 "// every name of worldLibs)."] [808 56 "// py_dl_open's audit (queue 598)"] [844 1 "// callAddress is _ctypes_callproc for call_function and call_cdeclfunction (queue 598): the function at addr called"] [845 1 "// with args converted by ConvParam, no argument types, its result a C int."]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[62 25] [68 22] [85 24] [109 24] [113 54] [132 25] [157 35] [196 101] [253 19] [320 47] [332 25] [335 23] [339 25] [360 26] [361 32] [369 26] [412 33] [432 33] [444 12] [444 41] [635 82] [639 27] [646 22] [646 30] [693 26] [710 39] [714 26] [716 33] [718 35] [723 61] [729 53] [730 25] [740 22] [808 41] [816 28] [822 40] [827 21] [827 29] [847 101]]} (go/file "callproc.go" :imports [

